Bundled third-party pieces keep their own licences:

- ui/assets/fonts/neucha-latin.woff2 — Neucha, SIL Open Font License 1.1
- ui/assets/fonts/roboto-latin-var.woff2 — Roboto, Apache License 2.0
- yt-dlp — The Unlicense. VidGrab downloads it at first run and runs it as a
  separate program from its own release; it is not linked into this code.
- Electron — MIT. ffmpeg, if present on the machine, is used as a separate
  program too.
